| [VerificationAssurance] is (deterministic_construction | stored_provider_replay | response_backed_fault_replay | structural_runtime_fault_only)

& [Classification] is deterministic
  + deterministic fixture reports emit deterministic_construction
  + completed rejected and control provider reports emit stored_provider_replay
  + fault reports with a retained failed response that recomputes exact fault text emit response_backed_fault_replay
  + fault reports whose canonical failure occurs without a retained failed response emit structural_runtime_fault_only

& [Compatibility] preserves report identity
  + no CycleReport field request profile provider exchange or report digest changes
  + assurance is added only to ReportVerification output
  + historical reports remain replayable under their original bytes

& [Integrity] refuses laundering
  + a present failed response must replay exactly or verification fails
  + a fault may not select or self-declare its assurance class
  + callers must not infer an unretained external cause from structural_runtime_fault_only

& [SatisfactionSignature] binds the assurance amendment
